    <string name="options_resolution_title">Resolution before launch</string>
    <string name="options_resolution_description">Choose the starting render resolution. Presets use the landscape height and preserve your screen aspect ratio, capped at native resolution. Lower values reduce GPU load. Keep game setting preserves the saved choice (720p default on first use). You can still change resolution inside the game.</string>
