    <string name="options_achievement_description">Advanced Steam achievements — applies next game launch. These switches control optional repair helpers. Normal gameplay unlocks, Steam validation, and pending-write retries remain active. Turning checks off can delay recovery of missed achievements; existing Steam unlocks stay unlocked. The award-event helper can schedule its own confirmation checks even when startup, lifecycle, and periodic checks are off.</string>
    <string name="options_repair">Enable missing-achievement repair helpers</string>
